            "review_title": "Review at Hareya",
            "review_text": "Paripatetico\nPrince Albert, Canada148 contributions\n0\nJapanese in HCM City\nJan 2019\nNot a lot of street appeal, but very welcoming staff, the cleanest kitchen imaginable (you pass it on your way up the long and winding staircase to the 3rd floor), and very tasty food indeed. Eating areas are fairly private. Prices are reasonable. Presentation is very good. Not quite fine dining, but worth every penny.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 6, 2019",
