            "review_text": "mur11\nSingapore164 contributions\n0\nValue for money, delicious!\nMar 2016\nWe stumbled upon this restaurant on a side street (near haagen daaz) while on the way back to the hotel. Food was delicious! Highly recommend the chicken meatball yakitori and stir fried US beef with mushrooms.\n\nThere was a little language barrier as the staff are not fluent in English (they speak Japanese and Vietnamese) but there's an English menu.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 25, 2016",
